+/*
+ * Record, during boot, what a device-tree-declared Cortex-A72 will need when it
+ * is onlined at ~240 s. Called from every CPU's enable, affected or not, and
+ * idempotent -- set_bit() and update_mitigation_state() both are -- so the
+ * eight A53s each run it and nothing depends on which of them got there first.
+ *
+ * Two things have to be true before the alternatives are patched, and only one
+ * of them is the loop count that spectre_bhb_loop_affected(SCOPE_SYSTEM) now
+ * supplies:
+ *
